# Claude Code auth inside the sandbox — pick ONE:
#
# (A) Subscription (no per-token billing). Generate a long-lived token on the
#     host with `claude setup-token` and paste it here. Headless Claude Code in
#     the container can't do an interactive login, so this token is required for
#     the subscription path. See https://github.com/mattpocock/sandcastle/issues/191
CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN=
#
# (B) API key (pay-per-token). Leave the token above empty and set this instead.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# GitHub token — the agent uses it to read issues, push the branch, and open PRs.
# Fine-grained token (https://github.com/settings/personal-access-tokens/new) with
# repository permissions: Contents (Read and write), Pull requests (Read and write),
# Issues (Read and write), Metadata (Read).
GH_TOKEN=
